		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61002","type":"text","text":"### Reference Documents & Mind Map\n\n- **[Master Document — Persona: School (Google Doc)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Pc3ZklC-CE0nURaoT34AqI0Wh_rmZxAv7rhPXetab7o/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.8jlh6gupbvr7)**\n  Owner: `ali.binyahia@schoolvoice.com` · Updated `2026-09-12`\n- **[Master Document Index (Google Doc)](https://docs.google.com/document/u/0/d/1boYrzUG4ewozJA5X48lFTy28VUaGoZiTzxVVrZvwi9o/edit)**\n  Top-level Schoolvoice documentation index\n- **[Master Document Mind Map (XMind)](https://xmind.ai/MdJa1HAY?xid=5sBt8BfT)**\n  Visual hierarchy & feature tree reference","x":2172,"y":-236,"width":516,"height":244,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61005","type":"text","text":"Open full note: [[00 - How Schoolvoice Works (Product Mental Model)]]\n\n**Core Thesis**: Combine **Daily Habit** + **One-Tap Action Loops** + **Governed Talk**.\n- **Loop 1 (Habit)**: Stories, Drive, Live -> daily opens\n- **Loop 2 (Action)**: 1-tap CTAs + SMS fallback + Smart Reminders\n- **Loop 3 (Talk)**: Number-private Chat, RBAC queues, recorded VoIP\n- **Governance**: Approvals, AI mod, extraction, Reach & District","x":12,"y":-236,"width":456,"height":244,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61004","type":"text","text":"## Why Schoolvoice Exists\n\nReplaces **two broken extremes**:\n1. **WhatsApp chaos** -> personal number leaks, zero audit trail, buried files\n2. **Legacy portals** -> monthly-only logins, missed approvals & fees\n\n**Solution**: Combine **Daily Habit** (Stories/Drive/Live) + **One-Tap Action Loops** + **Governed Talk & Analytics**.","x":792,"y":-236,"width":456,"height":244,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61006","type":"text","text":"## 5 Personas & Priorities\n\n- **#1 Parents / Guardians**: Zero-friction UX, PIN approvals, translated chat, timezone VoIP\n- **#1 School Admin**: Pre-send approvals, recall, chat extraction, VoIP quotas, reach reports\n- **#2 Teachers**: Grade/CSV targeting, `#variables`, Merge, own-student Stories, Drive\n- **Dept Teams**: Shared RBAC chat queues (Tuition, SEN, Bus, Counselling)\n- **District / Ministry**: Multi-school hierarchy & compliance","x":1340,"y":-240,"width":480,"height":244,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61007","type":"text","text":"Open full note: [[_Master Document Hub]]\n\nCentral Map of Content for **Persona: School**:\n- **15-Min Path**: Mental Model -> Overview -> 3 Loops -> Reports\n- **PO Audit**: Tracks `9 Admin TBAs` & `3 empty placeholders`\n- **Workspace Links**: [[1-TO-DO|Onboarding]] · [[After On-Boarding To-Do|Delete Story]] · [[Most-important|Priorities]]","x":12,"y":260,"width":456,"height":234,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61008","type":"text","text":"Open full note: [[01 - Overview & Value Proposition]]\n\n- **Mission**: Zero-barrier UX for parents of any age or tech skill\n- **Action-First**: 1-tap CTA cards instead of passive SMS/WhatsApp\n- **Doc Audit Gaps**:\n  - `Rewards & Challenges` listed at top, missing body section\n  - `Voice Calls` has full body section, omitted from top list","x":12,"y":644,"width":456,"height":224,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61009","type":"text","text":"## 10 Value Pillars\n\n- **User-Friendly** (any age / tech skill)\n- **Cost-Effective** (annual subscription)\n- **Privacy Assured** (no phone # leaks)\n- **Precision** (filters + `#variables`)\n- **Full Control** & **Contextual Clarity**\n- **Engagement** & **Live Reporting**\n- **All-in-One** + **Multilingual**","x":12,"y":1014,"width":456,"height":244,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61011","type":"text","text":"### Chat & Department Channels\n- Zero phone # leaks, **AI Moderation**, Translation, Voice Notes\n- Unlimited **RBAC Channels** (private parent threads, shared staff queue)\n- **Authorized Chat Extraction** + logged audit trail","x":822,"y":1159,"width":446,"height":159,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f6100a","type":"file","file":"1.1 Master-Document-School-Persona/Schoolvoice Modules.base","x":0,"y":1360,"width":480,"height":280,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f6101b","type":"file","file":"1. TO-DOs/After On-Boarding To-Do.md","x":2160,"y":1745,"width":540,"height":345,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61012","type":"text","text":"### In-App Recorded VoIP Calls\n- **1:1 Chat only** (disabled in broadcasts)\n- Mon–Fri 12–5 PM timezone-aware schedule (staff can still call out)\n- Relationship caller ID + **100% recorded** + monthly quota","x":822,"y":1429,"width":446,"height":104,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f6100c","type":"text","text":"Open full note: [[02 - Actionable Messages]]\n\n**Flagship feed module** replacing passive blasts with 1-tap CTA cards.\n\n**7-Part Card Anatomy**:\n1. Sender identity (photo/logo) + timestamp & `Urgent` flag\n2. Message summary preview + **child's photo** (multi-child clarity)\n3. Attachments (PDF/image/video/URL) + reminder tag + **CTA buttons**\n\n**Core Flow**:\nDraft (`#variables` / Merge) -> Approval Inbox -> Push + **10m Fallback SMS** -> **Smart Reminder** (non-responders only) -> **Live Action Report**","x":1322,"y":359,"width":456,"height":474},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61010","type":"text","text":"Open full note: [[03 - Chat & Voice Calls]]\n\nGoverned two-way communication **without personal phone # leaks**.\n\n- **1:1 Chat**: Translation, voice notes, teacher availability toggle, real-time **AI moderation**\n- **Department Channels**: Unlimited RBAC queues (Tuition, SEN, Bus, Counselling) with private parent threads\n- **Safeguarding**: Authorized **Chat Extraction** (audited) + **100% recorded 1:1 VoIP** (Mon–Fri 12–5 PM, monthly minute quota)","x":1322,"y":1159,"width":456,"height":374},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61017","type":"text","text":"Open full note: [[05 - Reports, District Management & Admin TBAs]]\n\n- **Adoption Analytics (PDF/CSV)**: Install Rate (Android/iOS) & **Reach Report** (`>= 1 active guardian`)\n- **District Governance**: Multi-school hierarchy, cross-school targeting, recall/delete enforcement\n- **PO Gap Tracker**: `9 Admin TBAs` + `Message delete` (#16) + `Parent feedback attachment` + `Stories Views`","x":2172,"y":359,"width":516,"height":244},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61018","type":"text","text":"### Analytics Triad (PDF / CSV Exports)\n- **Message Reports**: Action Status Chart, Read/Delivery Chart, Student Audit History\n- **Installation Report**: Guardians/Staff/Students %, Android vs. iOS versions\n- **Reach Report**: Student = Reached if **`>= 1` guardian is active**","x":2172,"y":739,"width":516,"height":169,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61019","type":"text","text":"### District & Ministry Scale\n- `District -> Branches/Operators -> Schools -> Grades/Sections/Groups`\n- Cross-school targeting, recall/delete enforcement & rolled-up reach analytics","x":2172,"y":1044,"width":516,"height":144,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f6101a","type":"text","text":"### PO Discovery Backlog & Gaps\n- **9 Admin Modules (`TBA`)**: Contact, Permission, Challenges, Absence, Structure, Profile, Modules, SMS, Logs\n- **Doc Mismatches**: `Rewards & Challenges` (listed at top, no body) vs. `Voice Calls` (full body, omitted at top)\n- **Empty Spec Items**: `Message delete` (#16), `Parent feedback attachment`, `Stories Views`","x":2172,"y":1324,"width":516,"height":249,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f6100d","type":"text","text":"### 8 One-Tap Action Types\n1. **Announcement** (`Read`)\n2. **Approval** (`Approve/Reject` + PIN)\n3. **Acknowledge** (`Acknowledge`)\n4. **Reply** (`1-to-many` / `many-to-many`)\n5. **Payment** (`Pay [amount]`)\n6. **Absence / Tardiness** (+ excuse upload)\n7. **Moment** (`View Moment`)\n8. **Emergency Alert** (`Call` · silent bypass)","x":822,"y":359,"width":446,"height":219,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f6100e","type":"text","text":"### Delivery, Scale & Safeguards\n- **Target & Personalize**: Grade/CSV + `#variables` + `Message Merge`\n- **Reliability Net**: Timed **Fallback SMS** (offline) + non-responder **Smart Reminder** bump\n- **Governance**: Approval Inbox, Post-send button toggle, Deadline, **Message Recall**, `Staff CC`","x":822,"y":689,"width":446,"height":144,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61015","type":"text","text":"### Why Daily Habit Matters\nKeeps parents opening Schoolvoice every day so urgent **Actionable Messages** aren't missed:\n- **Stories**: Private class moments, likes/saves, AI moderation, parent reporting\n- **Teachers Drive**: `Public`/`Private` cloud folders on teacher profile\n- **Schoolvoice Live**: In-app live video Q&As & events","x":822,"y":1859,"width":446,"height":219,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61014","type":"text","text":"Open full note: [[04 - Stories, Teachers Drive & Live Broadcasting]]\n\n- **Stories**: Private class moments (own students only), likes/saves, AI moderation & parent reporting\n- **Teachers Drive**: `Public`/`Private` subject & homework folders on teacher profiles\n- **Schoolvoice Live**: In-app live video Q&As & events (no Zoom/Meet links)","x":1322,"y":1859,"width":456,"height":219}
	],
